// Bazel-only Go workspace: go_deps (MODULE.bazel) resolves the gc module, the
// nogo analyzers' module (tools/nogo) and the source-built bd's module
// (tools/bd) as one dependency graph, so the analyzers link against the same
// golang.org/x/tools as rules_go's nogo runner and bd builds from the beads
// commit gc links. Not named go.work on purpose: the go command never picks it
// up, and `go build`/`go list -m all` in the repo root keep seeing only go.mod.
go 1.26.9

use (
	.
	./tools/bd
	./tools/nogo
)
